Package: funresMech
Title: Mechanistic Functional Response Analysis
Version: 1.0.2
Authors@R: 
    person("Segundo", "Núñez-Campero", 
           email = "segundo.nc@conicet.gov.ar", 
           role = c("aut", "cre"))
X-CRAN-Comment: Okuyama is a proper name
Description: Implements the mechanistic functional response model proposed by 
    Okuyama (2012) for host-parasitoid systems. Provides tools for model fitting, 
    likelihood profiling, stochastic simulation, and visualization of parasitism 
    distributions. Includes an interactive Shiny application for complete analysis 
    workflows. See Okuyama (2012) <doi= 10.1016/j.biocontrol.2011.10.008>.
